    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlanders: Hunt and Survive \u2013 A sci-fi survival action game where elite hunters from across the galaxy band together to battle monstrous threats on a savage, untamed planet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.poster.avif?t=1749750723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.webm?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.mp4?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: You play as a lone hunter stranded on a planet crawling with deadly alien creatures. Armed with high-tech weaponry and quick reflexes, you must fight, adapt, and survive against relentless hordes in fast-paced, explosive battles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Sci-Fi Combat: Wield an arsenal of energy rifles, plasma cannons, and experimental weapons to blast through waves of different monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Dominate: Unlock new abilities in the skill tree and exchange hunter\u2019s experience for combat perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth, outlander. The hunt begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.poster.avif?t=1749750723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.webm?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.mp4?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlanders: Hunt and Survive \u2013 A sci-fi survival action game where elite hunters from across the galaxy band together to battle monstrous threats on a savage, untamed planet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.poster.avif?t=1749750723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.webm?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/4f8a04377f5a680a6833b3b45581e343.mp4?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: You play as a lone hunter stranded on a planet crawling with deadly alien creatures. Armed with high-tech weaponry and quick reflexes, you must fight, adapt, and survive against relentless hordes in fast-paced, explosive battles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Sci-Fi Combat: Wield an arsenal of energy rifles, plasma cannons, and experimental weapons to blast through waves of different monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Dominate: Unlock new abilities in the skill tree and exchange hunter\u2019s experience for combat perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth, outlander. The hunt begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.poster.avif?t=1749750723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.webm?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689550/extras/fb1d4067398de949e51e4bf7c66ef90d.mp4?t=1749750723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
